<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech FinMin sets 26-wk T-bill auction Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Czech FinMin sets 26-wk T-bill auction Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech finance ministry will offer five billion crowns worth of 26-week treasury bills in an auction on Wednesday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The limit price in the American auction was set at 940,350 crowns implying a net yield of 12.55 percent, the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
